PN,36401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FThe Chief Constable of Merseyside
OL,7,FPolice says the force is taking a
OL,8,F"proactive" stance against illegal e-
OL,9,Fbikes after revealing that almost half
OL,10,Fof the region's recent shooting
OL,11,Foffenders used them.
OL,13,FChief Constable Rob Carden confirmed
OL,14,Fthere were 16 shooting incidents in
OL,15,F2025 - marking the lowest figure for
OL,16,Fgun crime recorded in the region for
OL,17,F"many years."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FHowever, officers are facing an
OL,7,Fevolving challenge as offenders
OL,8,Fincreasingly exploit high-powered e-
OL,9,Fbikes to commit crimes and evade
OL,10,Fofficers.
OL,12,FHe said: "We've got to be alive to
OL,13,Fthat with intelligence information,
OL,14,Fand that's why the information the
OL,15,Fpublic give us is so very important.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,F"There's a commitment there with the
OL,7,Fbikes seized already that if you
OL,8,Fprovide the information, we will
OL,9,Frespond. We are a proactive police
OL,10,Fforce that wants the police on the
OL,11,Ffront foot."
OL,13,FOffenders involved in antisocial
OL,14,Fbehaviour, drug supply and wider-
OL,15,Forganised criminality are using
OL,16,Fmodified bicycles which can reach
OL,17,Fspeeds of more than 60 miles per hour.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FAround 1,600 illegal e-bikes have been
OL,7,Fseized by Merseyside Police as part of
OL,8,FOperation Gears, a campaign to crack
OL,9,Fdown on their use in serious crime and
OL,10,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,12,FMr Carden, who took over the role in
OL,13,FSeptember 2025, clarified that he
OL,14,Fsupports the use of legal e-bikes that
OL,15,Fdo not exceed 250 Watts and 15.5 miles
OL,16,Fper hour, but has warned of the
OL,17,Fdangers of the modified vehicles.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FHe said: "We've got to be really clear
OL,7,Fhere, we're not looking at people who
OL,8,Fhave legal bikes, e-bikes that are
OL,9,Fdealt with in a very responsible way.
OL,11,F"We support that mode of transport.
OL,12,FIt's healthy, It's sustainable. But
OL,13,Fthe bridge is from electrically-
OL,14,Fassisted pedal cycles to almost
OL,15,Felectric motorbikes, and that bridge
OL,16,Fwith modification packs is illegal and
OL,17,Fdangerous."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FHe said that the involvement of e-
OL,7,Fbikes in shootings is not a surprise
OL,8,Fbecause they can transport weapons at
OL,9,Fspeed.
OL,11,F"They're agile. With the packs they
OL,12,Fcan be made quicker. They are easier
OL,13,Fto evade the police," he said.
OL,15,F"It gives them an angle and a real
OL,16,Foption that is difficult to police.
OL,17,FThe operations to tackle this issue
OL,18,Fare often resource-intensive."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FThe Chief Constable said that
OL,7,Fapprehending criminals on e-bikes can
OL,8,Finvolve a lot of police officers, but
OL,9,Foperations can also move to drones and
OL,10,Fair support.
OL,12,F"It is particularly challenging, but
OL,13,Fit's we've got to find a way of
OL,14,Fmeeting that challenge, and you can
OL,15,Fsee that we have had particular
OL,16,Fsuccesses," he added.
OL,18,F"400 bikes have been recovered since
OL,19,FApril, so the work is going in, but we
OL,20,Fhave just got to keep the pressure up."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FWhat are the rules for E-bikes in the
OL,7,FUK?
OL,9,FIn the UK, a legal e-bike is treated
OL,10,Fthe same as a standard bicycle,
OL,11,Fprovided it meets specific criteria.
OL,13,FThe e-bike is a hybrid form of
OL,14,Ftransport where part of the power
OL,15,Fcomes from the rider and the other
OL,16,Fpart from the motor.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FIt must feature pedal assistance, the
OL,7,Fmotor's continuous rated power output
OL,8,Fmust not exceed 250 Watts, and the
OL,9,Fassistance must cut off automatically
OL,10,Fonce the bike reaches 15.5mph.
OL,12,FThe rider must also be at least 14 on
OL,13,Fpublic roads.
OL,15,FAny vehicle designed or altered for
OL,16,Fhigher speeds, or operate without
OL,17,Fpedalling, is reclassified as a moped
OL,18,For motorcycle.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FMopeds or motorcycles require valid
OL,7,Flicensing, insurance, and full road-
OL,8,Flegal compliance. Failure to meet
OL,9,Fthese standards can lead to fines,
OL,10,Fpoints on a driving license, or
OL,11,Fvehicle seizure.
OL,13,FMr Carden has urged the public to
OL,14,Fcontinue to provide information about
OL,15,Fsuspected criminal activity and
OL,16,Fantisocial behaviour.
OL,18,FHe has also offered advice for parents
OL,19,Flooking to buy their children an e-
OL,20,Fbike that falls within the regulations.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,FHe said: "Do your research, go to a
OL,7,Freputable firm where you can get good
OL,8,Fadvice, a quality product, and go in
OL,9,Fthere with your eyes open.
OL,11,F"I would also look for things whether
OL,12,Fit be on the internet or otherwise
OL,13,Fthat talk about high speeds, "throttle
OL,14,Fand go" (rather than using the pedal),
OL,15,Fbut also converter packs, all those
OL,16,Fthings should send danger signals and
OL,17,Fa red light.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785401294
OL,3,CIllegal e-bikes used in 'nearly half
OL,4,Cof shootings'
OL,6,F"I think if the purchase is made and
OL,7,Fit's made responsibly and good
OL,8,Fdecisions have been made, a good lock
OL,9,Fand a tracker would also be thoroughly
OL,10,Fworthwhile."
OL,12,FWant more on the issues affecting the
OL,13,FNorth? Our podcast, From the North
OL,14,Fanswers the questions that matter to
OL,15,Four region.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/12
